<title>BELARUS: Belarus August inflation 1.3 vs 2.0 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Belarus August inflation 1.3 vs 2.0 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian monthly inflation rate edged down to 1.3 percent in August from July's 2.0 percent, the Statistics Ministry said.</p>
<p>    BELARUS CONSUMER PRICES AUG 96  JULY 96   AUG 95</p>
<p> mth/mth change (percent)    +1.3    +2.0	 +3.0</p>
<p> year-on-year change	  +42.0   +44.1     +755.0</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, 380 44 229-2264</p>
</text>
